# Table Components - Row Click Navigation Guidelines

## Overview
This document provides guidelines for AI agents on how to modify table components to ensure navigation only occurs when clicking on the **name field/column**, not on entire rows.

## Current Implementation Summary

### Before Changes
- **Problem**: Clicking anywhere on a table row would navigate to the record page
- **User Experience**: Too aggressive navigation, accidental clicks on data cells would trigger navigation
- **Implementation**: Row-level `onClick` handlers on entire `<TableRow>` or `onRow` prop in DataTable

### After Changes  
- **Solution**: Navigation only occurs when clicking specifically on the name field/column
- **User Experience**: More controlled navigation, only intentional clicks on name field navigate
- **Implementation**: Click handlers moved to name column render functions, row-level handlers removed

## Implementation Patterns

### 1. DataTable Components (Gravity UI Catalog)
**Used in**: AccountTable, LeadTable, ContactTable, OpportunityTable

#### Remove Row-Level Click Handler
```typescript
// BEFORE ❌
onRow={(record) => ({
  onClick: () => handleRowClick(record),
  className: selectedId === record.id ? 'gba:bg-blue-50' : '',
  style: { cursor: 'pointer' }
})}

// AFTER ✅
onRow={(record) => ({
  className: selectedId === record.id ? 'gba:bg-blue-50' : ''
})}
```

#### Add Click Handler to Name Column
```typescript
// BEFORE ❌
render: (_: any, record: RecordType) => (
  <div className="gba:flex gba:items-center gba:gap-3">
    {/* content */}
  </div>
)

// AFTER ✅  
render: (_: any, record: RecordType) => (
  <div 
    className="gba:flex gba:items-center gba:gap-3 gba:cursor-pointer gba:hover:bg-gray-50 gba:p-2 gba:rounded gba:transition-colors"
    onClick={(e) => {
      e.stopPropagation();
      handleRowClick(record);
    }}
  >
    {/* content */}
  </div>
)
```

### 2. Custom Table Components (NEWWORK Design System)
**Used in**: Investment tables (EquityTable, LiquidFundsTable, PrivateEquityTable, RealEstateTable)

#### Remove Row-Level Click Handler
```tsx
// BEFORE ❌
<TableRow 
  key={record.id}
  className="gba:border-b gba:hover:bg-gray-50 gba:transition-colors gba:cursor-pointer" 
  onClick={() => onRowClick(record.id)}
>

// AFTER ✅
<TableRow 
  key={record.id}
  className="gba:border-b gba:hover:bg-gray-50 gba:transition-colors" 
>
```

#### Add Click Handler to Name Column TableCell
```tsx
// BEFORE ❌
<TableCell className="gba:py-4 gba:px-6">
  <div>
    <div className="gba:font-semibold gba:text-gray-900 gba:mb-1">{record.name}</div>
    <div className="gba:text-sm gba:text-gray-600">{record.subType}</div>
  </div>
</TableCell>

// AFTER ✅
<TableCell className="gba:py-4 gba:px-6">
  <div 
    className="gba:cursor-pointer gba:hover:bg-gray-50 gba:p-2 gba:rounded gba:transition-colors"
    onClick={(e) => {
      e.stopPropagation();
      onRowClick && onRowClick(record.id);
    }}
  >
    <div className="gba:font-semibold gba:text-gray-900 gba:mb-1">{record.name}</div>
    <div className="gba:text-sm gba:text-gray-600">{record.subType}</div>
  </div>
</TableCell>
```

## Required Changes Checklist

When modifying table components to implement name-only navigation:

### For DataTable Components
- [ ] Remove `onClick` from `onRow` prop configuration
- [ ] Remove `style: { cursor: 'pointer' }` from `onRow` 
- [ ] Keep only `className` for selected row highlighting in `onRow`
- [ ] Add click handler to name column render function
- [ ] Add appropriate hover styles to name column
- [ ] Include `e.stopPropagation()` in name column click handler

### For Custom Table Components  
- [ ] Remove `onClick` prop from `<TableRow>` elements
- [ ] Remove `gba:cursor-pointer` from TableRow className
- [ ] Keep hover and transition styles on TableRow
- [ ] Add click handler wrapper div to name column TableCell
- [ ] Add hover styles to name column click area
- [ ] Include `e.stopPropagation()` in name column click handler
- [ ] Add null check for optional `onRowClick` prop

## Styling Guidelines

### Name Column Interactive Styling
```css
className="gba:cursor-pointer gba:hover:bg-gray-50 gba:p-2 gba:rounded gba:transition-colors"
```

### Required Click Handler Pattern
```typescript
onClick={(e) => {
  e.stopPropagation();
  handleRowClick(record); // or onRowClick && onRowClick(record.id)
}}
```

